# Install

lhtml-site is a Python package:

```sh
pip install lhtml-site
```

Build the site from the directory of `configure.yaml`, then open `.site/index.html`:

```sh
lhtml-site
lhtml-site --watch    # rebuilds on each save
```

The search box needs an index, built after the site by Pagefind (see
[Search](../../02_guides/03_search/index.html)).
